 title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是通用 ML 检验；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9cce8d80854a926\" href=\"?note=d9cce8d80854a926\" title=\"20-thm-universal-ml\">20-thm-universal-ml</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}random\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}\\vdash\nC_n:=2^\\omega\\setminus U_n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C_n),\\qquad\n\\mu(C_n)\\ge1-2^{-n}&gt;0,\\qquad\n\\forall X\\in C_n\\ \\operatorname{MLRandom}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}random\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}\\vdash\nC_n:=2^\\omega\\setminus U_n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C_n),\\qquad\n\\mu(C_n)\\ge1-2^{-n}&gt;0,\\qquad\n\\forall X\\in C_n\\ \\operatorname{MLRandom}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不在第 n 层的序列不在全部层的交，故通过通用检验。原书 PDF 的补集横线在文本抽取中丢失，此处已按完整逻辑重建。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 11.2.2；印刷页 191；PDF 第 222 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-universal-ml","status":"resolved","id":"d9cce8d80854a926","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-universal-ml]]","embed"